<title>
Center Console Box Removal and Installation
</title>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A9806020001">
<title>
Removal
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove shift garnish ornament (1) and floor console box front garnish (5).
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove cup holder (4) and console box cap (6).
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Disconnect seat heater switch connector (if equipped).
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove seat heater switch (10) (if equipped).
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove floor console side covers (2) and floor console box (3) in the assembled state.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove bolts and floor console box front bracket (7).
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove bolts and floor console box center bracket (8).
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove bolts and floor console box rear bracket (9).
</ptxt>
